WEBVTT

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.430
All right.

00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:09.160
Elaine, Elaine, quick, we've got to get away.

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:10.080
El Shaitan's here.

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:17.170
El Shaitan's plane.

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:27.910
Reading you, Master.

00:02:28.230 --> 00:02:29.770
Your messenger did not tell us you were coming.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.260
Hi, Sentinel Messenger. He must be a spy.

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:55.050
Hi. Do hide in here. I'll try and draw him in another direction.

00:02:55.210 --> 00:02:56.410
Watch your tent and run for it.

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:04.820
Look, Dream!

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:11.900
Look, El Cador! A plane!

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:13.570
It's El Shaitan!

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:14.220
Forward!

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.040
I'm up, but a man escaped.

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:29.730
flesh.

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:44.360
It was lucky for us to arrive when he did.

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:47.120
Now will you believe that he's not El Shaitan?

00:04:49.150 --> 00:04:50.150
I don't know what to say.

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:57.380
It's true that he helped us, but every time that I've tried to capture El Shaitan, El Cador has blocked my way.

00:04:57.740 --> 00:04:59.960
I do not have to account to you for my...

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:06.230
actions, Lieutenant Wayne. You are a fugitive from justice, wanted for gun

00:05:06.230 --> 00:05:10.610
running and murder. Miss Corday knows that I'm not guilty. Her brother left a

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:16.120
letter clearing me of those charges. Indeed. Where is the letter? Show it to

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:21.700
him, Elaine. Tom, I haven't got the letter. I lost it when El Chaitin's men captured me.

00:05:21.950 --> 00:05:25.690
In that case, it's my duty as a loyal servant of France to arrest Lieutenant

00:05:25.690 --> 00:05:27.970
Wayne and turn him over to Colonel Duval.

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:36.700
My mind is made up. Come, we'll escort you to your home.

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:06.800
Olly, when you found my brother's letter after his death, why did you open it?

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:10.230
Missed it. I did no such thing.

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:11.330
Oh, yes, you did.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:14.560
And you cut off the part of the letter that accused El Shaitan.

00:06:15.820 --> 00:06:18.440
Part of the letter? I do not understand.

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:24.460
You needn't lie, Olly, because Lieutenant Wayne recovered the missing part and gave it back to me.

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:28.140
I won't keep a servant. I cannot trust. You are discharged.

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:53.100
I'll wait on Miss Corday myself.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:56.000
I'm always happy to serve you, Miss Corday.

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:57.360
Oh, thank you, Mr. Raskin.

00:06:57.840 --> 00:06:59.120
I want you to get me another service.

00:06:59.500 --> 00:06:59.940
Place the bomb.

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:04.280
Certainly, Miss Corday, I know just the man, a very trustworthy fellow.

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:06.950
If you wait here a moment, I'll see if I can find him.

00:07:28.770 --> 00:07:29.970
I have news from Al Chaitan.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:31.520
Miss Corday has the letter.

00:07:32.060 --> 00:07:33.520
El Chaitan no longer fears the letter.

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:35.000
He's ready to strike.

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:37.210
You mean the guns and ammunition of the crime?

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:38.930
Yes, they're here in our warehouse.

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:40.870
What if Ratkin should find out about them?

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:42.460
Ratkin's an old fool.

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:43.840
He leaves everything to me.

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:46.840
Besides, the arms will be distributed tonight.

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:50.810
Tomorrow, El Chaitan will drive off the French

00:07:50.810 --> 00:07:52.430
and make himself master of the country.

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:04.220
Bulls, Elaine Corday was spying on you.

00:08:04.680 --> 00:08:05.060
Stop her.

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:13.420
Come on, L.C. Dance Corps.

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:29.900
Come on, the bell shakes.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:32.440
We can warn all those loyals to the cause.

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:02.010
Them brown devils are asking! Come on!

00:09:05.180 --> 00:09:07.280
Oh boy, what a fight this is going to be!

00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:31.180
Maybe you'll believe this one!

00:10:13.740 --> 00:10:16.900
Yeah, they go pretty soon.

00:10:18.270 --> 00:10:19.470
Get to Colonel Duvall.

00:10:20.230 --> 00:10:22.970
Chetan has guns and ammunition stored it right to their house.

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:24.330
I'll see if they're going.

00:10:43.850 --> 00:10:44.150
wounded.

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:11.560
I'm sorry, miss, but the colonel's busy.

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:14.200
It's no use discussing this any further, Major Booth.

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:18.520
Tom Wayne is a prisoner of France, and I refuse to turn him over to you.

00:11:18.730 --> 00:11:21.810
But the American embassy has ordered me to bring him back to Paris for trial.

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:26.670
The murder of Armand Corday is a local affair, and Wayne will be tried here.

00:11:28.780 --> 00:11:29.940
You've not heard the last of this.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:30.540
Colonel Duval.

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:31.640
Good day.

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:41.640
Corday, sir.

00:11:41.980 --> 00:11:42.420
Sure is.

00:11:48.900 --> 00:11:51.970
You know, the Colonel ought to give us medals

00:11:51.970 --> 00:11:53.230
for helping Miss Corday.

00:11:53.450 --> 00:11:55.750
The least he could do is if he'd give us a week's leave.

00:11:56.430 --> 00:11:58.730
Think of it, a week with no drilling to do.

00:12:00.090 --> 00:12:04.160
Your discovery of El Chaitan's plot is of great service to France, Miss Corday.

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:08.000
I never would have lived to tell it, if it hadn't been for the Three Musketeers.

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:09.760
I'll see that they are properly rewarded.

00:12:15.470 --> 00:12:17.930
See that Miss Corday is escorted safely to her home.

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:20.610
And send the Three Musketeers to me.

00:12:20.730 --> 00:12:27.120
Say again, eh?

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:29.460
Colonel, we had to help.

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:29.860
Silence!

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:32.690
I'll teach you not to stir up trouble with the Arabs.

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:36.670
You, Renard, will do kitchen police until relieved.

00:12:37.420 --> 00:12:40.130
And you, Schmidt, will do guard duty in the cell block.

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:44.660
And you, Clancy, will do punishment bill in full marching order.

00:12:48.690 --> 00:12:49.850
Reward of a hero.

00:12:55.820 --> 00:12:57.520
That's what you get for helping a dame.

00:12:57.800 --> 00:12:58.120
Nurse!

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:01.450
And this is what I get.

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:06.380
You mean to say Colonel Duvall hasn't sent any men to seize those guns?

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:07.220
Not yet.

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:09.290
And he punished you three for...

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:12.560
Smith, I tell you, he's working with El Chey Tan.

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:15.140
I gotta get out of here.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:16.200
But how can you?

00:13:36.140 --> 00:13:38.600
He was delirious a moment ago, doctor. He must have a high fever.

00:13:58.800 --> 00:13:59.840
So, you're all trouble, eh?

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:02.820
No wonder, Smitty. You eat too much.

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:06.610
Oh, doctor, if you'll just give me some more of those pills...

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:24.100
There you are, Smitty.

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:36.000
Temperature 104 degrees the patient must be removed from the hospital at once

00:15:00.450 --> 00:15:07.660
The prisoner Wayne has escaped, Colonel.

00:15:08.350 --> 00:15:09.570
Start the town and bring him back!

00:15:39.780 --> 00:15:40.400
Master.

00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:44.000
Lose no time. They must be distributed tonight.

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:44.860
True be done, Master.

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:15.120
Wade.

00:16:16.796 --> 00:16:17.056
Wait.

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:18.820
I have a better idea.

00:16:44.588 --> 00:16:46.588
The next time you see rifles...

00:16:47.276 --> 00:16:49.936
You'll be looking down the barrels of a firing squad.

00:16:50.636 --> 00:16:52.276
So you are, Al Shaitan.

00:16:53.100 --> 00:16:54.280
Resisting arrest, eh?
